# --- PROJECT SPECIFIC (Trash Tracker) ---

# Ignore the massive 800px datasets (Images are too big for GitHub)
# Keep your code, but keep your raw images local or in a cloud drive
**/datasets/
**/data/raw/

# Ignore YOLO training checkpoints and logs
**/runs/
**/wandb/
*.pt.tmp

# Keep the final model weights!
# (Don't ignore .tflite or .pt if they are the finished versions)

# Jupyter / notebook tooling clutter
.ipynb_checkpoints/
anaconda_projects/
ml_output/test_images/*
!ml_output/test_images/.gitkeep

# Secrets (copy notebooks/.env.example to notebooks/.env and fill in your key)
notebooks/.env

# Roboflow dataset downloads (regenerated by the notebook's download cell)
ml_output/trash_tracker-*/

# Base model weights auto-downloaded by ultralytics (e.g. yolo26n.pt, yolo26s.pt)
/*.pt
ml_output/*.pt

# INT8 calibration data auto-downloaded by ultralytics during TFLite export
ml_output/calibration_image_sample_data_*.npy
